{"book":"malachi","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:14:36.270168896Z","verse":6,"ref":"malachi 1:6","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":1,"translation":"A son honors ⟨his⟩ father, and a servant ⟨his⟩ master. And if ⟨I am⟩ a father, where ⟨is⟩ my honor? And if masters, where ⟨is⟩ my fear? — says YHWH of hosts to you, the priests, ⟨who are⟩ despisers of my name. And you say, ‘In what have we despised ⟨את⟩ your name?’","tokens":[{"surface":"בן","gloss":"A son"},{"surface":"יכבד","gloss":"honors"},{"surface":"אב","gloss":"father"},{"surface":"ועבד","gloss":"and a servant"},{"surface":"אדניו","gloss":"his master"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"And if"},{"surface":"אב","gloss":"a father"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I am"},{"surface":"איה","gloss":"where"},{"surface":"כבודי","gloss":"my honor"},{"surface":"ואם","gloss":"And if"},{"surface":"אדונים","gloss":"masters"},{"surface":"אני","gloss":"I am"},{"surface":"איה","gloss":"where"},{"surface":"מוראי","gloss":"my fear"},{"surface":"אמר","gloss":"says"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"YHWH"},{"surface":"צבאות","gloss":"of hosts"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"הכהנים","gloss":"the priests"},{"surface":"בוזי","gloss":"despisers of"},{"surface":"שמי","gloss":"my name"},{"surface":"ואמרתם","gloss":"And you say"},{"surface":"במה","gloss":"In what"},{"surface":"בזינו","gloss":"have we despised"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"your name"},{"surface":"שמך","gloss":"your name"}]}